{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgj93mRhjKnQJJ3ZzXgX4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018cvmMr87mUgc9dxEpK9daQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n -i 'diablo\\|action rpg\\|action-rpg\\|arpg\\|hack' AI_GUIDE.md API-INDEX.md | head -40; sed -n 402,420p AI_GUIDE.md","description":"Find action RPG recipes in guide and index"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6883,"cache_read_input_tokens":85963,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6883},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d255c30e-7719-4824-967e-28ca23bddd23","uuid":"ce80a345-46d6-40b7-ab4c-2e4d788a7218","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:20:31.437Z","request_id":"req_011Cgj93m7bhuwRJFjPMppHU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_018cvmMr87mUgc9dxEpK9daQ":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211938__x30f875/work/.research/engine/dist/handoff && grep -n -i 'diablo\\|action rpg\\|action-rpg\\|arpg\\|hack' AI_GUIDE.md API-INDEX.md | head -40; sed -n 402,420p AI_GUIDE.md","description":"Find action RPG recipes in guide and index"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_018cvmMr87mUgc9dxEpK9daQ":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211938__x30f875/work/.research/engine/dist/handoff"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018cvmMr87mUgc9dxEpK9daQ","type":"tool_result","content":"AI_GUIDE.md:607:`examples/emberdeep.html` is the engine's signature game: an endless Diablo-style hack-and-slash of about 2 MB of code, built from some fifty source files. Its structure (`src/emberdeep/DESIGN.md`) scales to any large game.\nAPI-INDEX.md:272:- `E.Input.DEFAULT { attack, dash, skill, jump }`: top-down / isometric action (Zelda, Diablo): Space dashes, J or click attacks\n## Genre recipes\nEach recipe names the kit to start from (`kits/<id>.js` in the handoff package). The 3D ones build on the 3D engine, whose kits are on the site and in the repository, not in the handoff package.\n\n**Side-scroller (Mario, Mega Man, Castlevania).**\n```js\nconst level = new E.PlatformMap({ rows: LEVEL, legend: { '#': 1, '=': 2, '?': 3, '@': 'hero', 'g': 'walker' },\n  types: { 1: { style: 'ground', side: '#8a5a32' }, 2: { kind: 'oneway' }, 3: { style: 'bonus', side: '#e8a830' } } });\nconst s = level.find('hero'), hero = new E.Platformer({ x: s.x, z: s.z }), rig = new E.Humanoid({ weapon: 'gun', hat: 'cap' });\n// scene: { view: 'side', views: ['side', 'brawler'], input: 'PLATFORMER', res: 'snes', pausable: true, ... }\n// update: hero.update(dt, level, game.input, lifts); if (hero.jumped) game.audio.sfx('jump');\n//         if (hero.bumped) { ...change level.set(cx, cz, id)... }\n//         rig.update(dt, hero.rigState({ point: game.input.down('attack') })); game.focus(hero.x, 0, hero.z + 24);\n// draw:   r.sky([...]); level.draw(r); r.actor(hero.x, 0, hero.z, (g, ox, oy) => rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view));\n```\n- Enemies are boxes moved by `level.move(e, dt)` with your own gravity: turn at `hitWall`, and at ledges using `groundBelow`.\n- Stomp when `hero.vz < 0` and the hero's feet are above the enemy's middle.\n- Pits: `hero.z < -40`. Spikes: `level.touching(hero, 'hazard')`.\n- Further moves, on request: `new E.Platformer({ crouch: true, ledge: true, wallCling: true, momentum: true })`; tiles of `kind: 'water' | 'rope' | 'bars'`, and grip on any tile type: `friction` (ice: .15), `carry` (a conveyor's speed), `bounce` (a spring), `crumble` with `respawn` (call `level.update(dt)` each step); `hero.swingFrom(x, z)` hangs it from a grapple point. Draw `level.drawWater(r)` after the actors; `rigState()` poses every move (hang, climb, crawl, swim, swing).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d255c30e-7719-4824-967e-28ca23bddd23","uuid":"eb2bdc00-9e92-409c-a67b-475c338704eb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:20:31.482Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"AI_GUIDE.md:607:`examples/emberdeep.html` is the engine's signature game: an endless Diablo-style hack-and-slash of about 2 MB of code, built from some fifty source files. Its structure (`src/emberdeep/DESIGN.md`) scales to any large game.\nAPI-INDEX.md:272:- `E.Input.DEFAULT { attack, dash, skill, jump }`: top-down / isometric action (Zelda, Diablo): Space dashes, J or click attacks\n## Genre recipes\nEach recipe names the kit to start from (`kits/<id>.js` in the handoff package). The 3D ones build on the 3D engine, whose kits are on the site and in the repository, not in the handoff package.\n\n**Side-scroller (Mario, Mega Man, Castlevania).**\n```js\nconst level = new E.PlatformMap({ rows: LEVEL, legend: { '#': 1, '=': 2, '?': 3, '@': 'hero', 'g': 'walker' },\n  types: { 1: { style: 'ground', side: '#8a5a32' }, 2: { kind: 'oneway' }, 3: { style: 'bonus', side: '#e8a830' } } });\nconst s = level.find('hero'), hero = new E.Platformer({ x: s.x, z: s.z }), rig = new E.Humanoid({ weapon: 'gun', hat: 'cap' });\n// scene: { view: 'side', views: ['side', 'brawler'], input: 'PLATFORMER', res: 'snes', pausable: true, ... }\n// update: hero.update(dt, level, game.input, lifts); if (hero.jumped) game.audio.sfx('jump');\n//         if (hero.bumped) { ...change level.set(cx, cz, id)... }\n//         rig.update(dt, hero.rigState({ point: game.input.down('attack') })); game.focus(hero.x, 0, hero.z + 24);\n// draw:   r.sky([...]); level.draw(r); r.actor(hero.x, 0, hero.z, (g, ox, oy) => rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view));\n```\n- Enemies are boxes moved by `level.move(e, dt)` with your own gravity: turn at `hitWall`, and at ledges using `groundBelow`.\n- Stomp when `hero.vz < 0` and the hero's feet are above the enemy's middle.\n- Pits: `hero.z < -40`. Spikes: `level.touching(hero, 'hazard')`.\n- Further moves, on request: `new E.Platformer({ crouch: true, ledge: true, wallCling: true, momentum: true })`; tiles of `kind: 'water' | 'rope' | 'bars'`, and grip on any tile type: `friction` (ice: .15), `carry` (a conveyor's speed), `bounce` (a spring), `crumble` with `respawn` (call `level.update(dt)` each step); `hero.swingFrom(x, z)` hangs it from a grapple point. Draw `level.drawWater(r)` after the actors; `rigState()` poses every move (hang, climb, crawl, swim, swing).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018cvmMr87mUgc9dxEpK9daQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
