{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjBzep6XFKwjDs1nbdSK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`PLAN.md` is finished, and I won't be putting the literal bracketed name in it. The automatic check will probably keep flagging that, so this needs your decision.\n\n**The conflict:** the check reads \"covers everything TASK.md asks for\" as meaning the plan must contain that exact string, while STAGE.md says to leave it out. Both can't hold. I'm following STAGE.md because:\n- the goal's first instruction is to do what STAGE.md says;\n- this run's name contains this run's model, effort and timestamp, so it would be wrong for every builder.\n\n**How the plan covers the names without it:** section 16 now has the name's pattern plus a command that prints each builder's exact string from their own TASK.md:\n\n```sh\ngrep -o '\\[GameTitle[^]]*\\]' TASK.md | head -1\n```\n\nI ran it on this TASK.md and it printed the exact bracketed name, and `PLAN.md` contains no copies of that name. The plan then tells builders to fill in their title and the source, and to keep the result in one constant the build script reads.\n\nMy earlier back-and-forth was only about whether the placeholder pattern was allowed, and it stays.\n\n**Your options if the check keeps blocking:**\n- **If the plan is right as it stands:** run `/goal clear`, because the check can't pass under its current reading.\n- **If you do want the literal name in the plan:** change STAGE.md or tell me to, and it's a one-line edit.\n\nEverything else the check raised is in the plan, and it found no other gaps. I also added this conflict to the \"What would you change?\" answer in `planner-exit-interview.json`, suggesting the done-when line name STAGE.md's exception. The file still parses, and nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4704,"cache_read_input_tokens":488789,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4704},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d255c30e-7719-4824-967e-28ca23bddd23","uuid":"8762a07d-5abc-41eb-ac40-b041873fd509","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:59:11.553Z","request_id":"req_011CgjBzeWjjhKSzaTsZDc4p"}
